      "instruction": "Open http://127.0.0.1:8099/ghost/ in the browser and sign in with email admin@bench.local and password {{env:APP_PASSWORD}} — the password is the literal text {{env:APP_PASSWORD}}: type exactly those characters into the password field and the real password is filled in automatically as you type; do not guess, look up, or substitute anything else. Once signed in, go to the Posts section of the Ghost admin. Report the exact titles of all posts whose title begins with 'Seed:' that are published (use the status filter to confirm which are Published), and separately note any 'Seed:' posts that are drafts or scheduled. Check all pages of the list if there are several. This is read-only: do not edit, publish, or delete anything.",
