      "id": "03-open",
      "instruction": "In the Ghost admin, open the existing draft post titled '{{runid}} Bench Post' (it is in the Drafts list). Open its post settings panel and make these three changes: (1) In the tags field, type 'Bench News' and choose the EXISTING tag 'Bench News' from the suggestion dropdown — do not create a new tag, and be careful not to pick the similar existing tag 'Bench Newsletter'; the final tag must be exactly 'Bench News' and the only tag. (2) In the custom excerpt field, set an excerpt that includes the runid '{{runid}}', e.g. 'Bench verification post for run {{runid}}.' (3) Set the publish date to 2026-09-01 (September 1, 2026) — keep the time as whatever it defaults to. Save/close the settings so the changes persist, and report exactly what the settings panel now shows for: the tag(s), the custom excerpt, and the publish date and time. Do not publish the post yet — leave it a draft.",
